                    <div class="sidearm-staff-member-bio-header-details sidearm-common-bio-details sidearm-staff-member-bio-header-no-image sidearm-common-bio-no-image">
                        

                        <h2 class="sidearm-staff-member-bio-heading sidearm-common-bio-heading">
                            <div class="medium-flex">
                                <span class="sidearm-staff-member-bio-name sidearm-common-bio-name">
                                    <span>Nikita</span>
                                    <span>Cordes, MS, LAT, ATC</span>
                                </span>
                                <div class="sidearm-roster-player-social flex flex-wrap flex-align-center">               
                                    <div class="sidearm-roster-player-social flex flex-wrap">            
                                    
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </h2>
                        
                        <div class="sidearm-staff-member-bio-fields sidearm-common-bio-fields flex flex-item-1">
                            <ul class="sidearm-staff-member-bio-fields-row flex row flex-wrap">
                                
                                    <li class="large-6 flex columns">
                                        <dl class="flex-item-1">
                                            <dt>Title</dt>
                                            <dd>Head Athletic Trainer</dd>
                                        </dl>
                                    </li>
                                
                                    <li class="large-6 flex columns">
                                        <dl class="flex-item-1">
                                            <dt>Email</dt>
                                            <dd><a href="mailto:cordesn593@macomb.edu">cordesn593@macomb.edu</a></dd>
                                        </dl>
                                    </li>
                                
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="clear"></div>
                    </div>

                </header>

                <div class="sidearm-common-bio-full">
                    Cordes, a nationally certified athletic trainer through the National Athletic Trainer's Association (NATA) and a Michigan licensed athletic trainer, joined Macomb in August 2025 as part of Team Rehab.<br>
<br>
A 2024 graduate of Northern Michigan University's (NMU) Undergraduate Sport Science program, Cordes went on to secure her master of science degree in athletic training from NMU in 2025. From 2023-2025, Cordes had clinical rotations at NMU working with multiple NCAA Division II sports including basketball, cross country, football, soccer, track & field and wrestling (Greco-Roman and freestyle). Most recently, Cordes completed an internship with Clarkston High School where she worked with sports such as baseball, lacrosse, softball, tennis and more.<br>
<br>
In addition to athletic training certifications and her recent degrees, Cordes is certified in First Aid and CPR/AED through the American Heart Association.
                </div>
            </article>

